# Firmware

- Real-time gait, IMU, e-stop, and servo comms belong on the motion MCU, not the Uno as a long-term brain.
- Uno + PCA9685 firmware is bring-up only (Phase 1).
- Production: UART/USB command protocol from Pi, 50–100 Hz (or faster) servo loop, current/temp limits if the bus supports them.
- Never command a walk gait without documented current limits and a hardware e-stop path.
